                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Played this as a kid for free on the browser whenever i came back from school, and i'm so glad to see this on steam so much so and it's just as fun as back in the old days with the classic pack. The newer game is pretty good too, abilet a little story heavy for my liking, but the QOL stuff like sliding into enemies is .. dare i say.. fancy. xD\n\nFancy Pants shows you don't need to be everything at once in order to have fun, and who can get mad at that? It's knows what it is and nails it: Being fun and fancy. =^)",
